1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,975
Did you know your body is like a wonderful
machine

2
00:00:02,975 --> 00:00:04,607
working all the time to keep

3
00:00:04,607 --> 00:00:06,607
you going?

4
00:00:06,607 --> 00:00:08,608
Let me tell you its story

5
00:00:08,608 --> 00:00:09,518
Inside your chest

6
00:00:09,518 --> 00:00:11,489
there's a special pump called the heart

7
00:00:11,489 --> 00:00:14,089
Just like how a faucet pushes water through
pipes

8
00:00:14,089 --> 00:00:15,234
your heart pumps blood

9
00:00:15,234 --> 00:00:17,234
through your body

10
00:00:17,234 --> 00:00:20,690
This blood carries important things like oxygen
and nutrients to all the

11
00:00:20,690 --> 00:00:21,399
different parts

12
00:00:21,399 --> 00:00:22,995
helping them stay healthy and strong

13
00:00:22,995 --> 00:00:23,306
Next

14
00:00:23,306 --> 00:00:24,995
let's talk about your lungs

15
00:00:24,995 --> 00:00:28,451
Imagine them like big sponges that fill up and
squeeze out air

16
00:00:28,451 --> 00:00:29,775
When you take a breath

17
00:00:29,775 --> 00:00:31,562
your lungs fill with fresh air

18
00:00:31,562 --> 00:00:32,771
giving your blood the

19
00:00:32,771 --> 00:00:34,771
oxygen it needs

20
00:00:34,771 --> 00:00:38,228
You can feel them working every time you
breathe in and out

21
00:00:38,228 --> 00:00:40,228
Your brain is like the boss!

22
00:00:40,228 --> 00:00:43,109
It's the one in charge of all your body's jobs

23
00:00:43,109 --> 00:00:44,255
It helps you think

24
00:00:44,255 --> 00:00:44,555
play

25
00:00:44,555 --> 00:00:45,701
and learn every day

26
00:00:45,701 --> 00:00:47,084
Imagine it as a supercomputer

27
00:00:47,084 --> 00:00:49,158
sending messages quickly through your body to

28
00:00:49,158 --> 00:00:50,509
control everything you do

29
00:00:50,509 --> 00:00:52,902
from blinking your eyes to jumping up and down

30
00:00:52,902 --> 00:00:53,709
And your bones

31
00:00:53,709 --> 00:00:56,128
they are like the strong frame of a building

32
00:00:56,128 --> 00:00:56,936
supporting your

33
00:00:56,936 --> 00:00:58,936
body and helping you move

34
00:00:58,936 --> 00:01:00,219
There are 206 of them

35
00:01:00,219 --> 00:01:03,543
all working together to keep you on your feet and
protect

36
00:01:03,543 --> 00:01:05,543
your important insides

